      "start_seconds": 1.17,
      "end_seconds": 9.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.74,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.55,
      "end_seconds": 15.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.11,
      "end_seconds": 24.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "mainly a muffled voice there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.4,
      "end_seconds": 30.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "So, how long has it it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.32,
      "end_seconds": 35.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I've had it for about four days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.14,
      "end_seconds": 39.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.55,
      "end_seconds": 47.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "a eight out of ten, I suppose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.54,
      "end_seconds": 60.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.88,
      "end_seconds": 75.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.77,
      "end_seconds": 95.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 92 percent, heart rate 84, temperature 37.3, blood pressure 119 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.52,
      "end_seconds": 101.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.27,
      "end_seconds": 103.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.05,
      "end_seconds": 106.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.87,
      "end_seconds": 124.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "you are sitting forward, drooling, and your breathing is noisy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.97,
      "end_seconds": 134.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "you can sit up now. Did you get cough or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.11,
      "end_seconds": 138.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.51,
      "end_seconds": 142.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.09,
      "end_seconds": 145.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "nothing else aches"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.99,
      "end_seconds": 151.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.86,
      "end_seconds": 155.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.68,
      "end_seconds": 173.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.96,
      "end_seconds": 178.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "I had part of my thyroid removed years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.88,
      "end_seconds": 182.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.67,
      "end_seconds": 186.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.27,
      "end_seconds": 209.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.11,
      "end_seconds": 222.09,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.86,
      "end_seconds": 228.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.85,
      "end_seconds": 231.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "no, no conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.98,
      "end_seconds": 259.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.94,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with a possible airway infection that needs emergency care at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.66,
      "end_seconds": 264.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.25,
      "end_seconds": 280.54,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible airway infection that needs emergency care, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book an urgent airway assessment to look into stridor and drooling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.51,
      "end_seconds": 283.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "mm, alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.33,
      "end_seconds": 296.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "Do not lie flat, I am calling an ambulance now. I'll want another look straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.72,
      "end_seconds": 299.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.97,
      "end_seconds": 303.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}